@host = http://localhost:8080
@apiKey = demo-key
@adminApiKey = 在这里填写.env.local中的SUPPORT_ADMIN_API_KEY

### 1. RAG 知识问答
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
X-Tenant-Id: tenant-a
X-User-Id: user-001

{"conversationId":"demo-1","message":"E03 是什么，应该怎样处理？","confirmWrite":false}

### 2. Function Tool：查询设备状态
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
X-Tenant-Id: tenant-a
X-User-Id: user-001

{"conversationId":"demo-1","message":"查询 device-001 当前状态和电量","confirmWrite":false}

### 3. 写工具第一次调用：应要求确认
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
X-Tenant-Id: tenant-a
X-User-Id: user-001

{"conversationId":"demo-2","message":"给 device-001 创建工单，E03 反复出现","confirmWrite":false}

### 4. 用户确认后执行；重复相同幂等键只会生成一张工单
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
X-Tenant-Id: tenant-a
X-User-Id: user-001

{"conversationId":"demo-2","message":"确认给 device-001 创建工单，E03 反复出现","idempotencyKey":"ticket-demo-001","confirmWrite":true}

### 5. SSE 流式输出
POST {{host}}/api/chat/stream
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
X-Tenant-Id: tenant-a
X-User-Id: user-001

{"conversationId":"demo-stream","message":"如何处理设备离线？","confirmWrite":false}

### 6. 管理员更新知识库
POST {{host}}/api/admin/knowledge
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{adminApiKey}}
X-Tenant-Id: tenant-a
X-User-Id: admin-001
X-Role: ADMIN

{"documentId":"demo-faq","title":"演示 FAQ","source":"faq/demo.md","content":"演示模式下，蓝色按钮用于启动设备，红色按钮用于停止设备。"}

### 7. 运行 50 条检索评测
POST {{host}}/api/admin/evaluations/run?mode=retrieval&limit=50
X-API-Key: {{adminApiKey}}
X-Tenant-Id: tenant-a
X-User-Id: admin-001
X-Role: ADMIN

### 8. 健康检查与 Prometheus 指标
GET {{host}}/actuator/health

###
GET {{host}}/actuator/prometheus

### 9. 服务端解析当前凭据的真实身份（改请求头不能变成管理员）
GET {{host}}/api/session
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 10. 查看候选召回、重排得分和最终 TopK
POST {{host}}/api/admin/knowledge/search
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{adminApiKey}}

{"query":"E03 主刷卡住怎么办","rerank":true}

### 11. 不重排的检索基线
POST {{host}}/api/admin/evaluations/run?mode=retrieval-baseline&limit=50
X-API-Key: {{adminApiKey}}

### 12. 真实回答与引用评测（ai 模式会调用外部模型、产生费用）
POST {{host}}/api/admin/evaluations/run?mode=agent&limit=50
X-API-Key: {{adminApiKey}}

### 13. 真实工具轨迹评测（不确认写入）
POST {{host}}/api/admin/evaluations/run?mode=tools&limit=10
X-API-Key: {{adminApiKey}}

### 14. 删除上面手工创建的 FAQ
DELETE {{host}}/api/admin/knowledge/demo-faq
X-API-Key: {{adminApiKey}}
